<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">carapace-ward</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

An enchantment applied to body armor. Chitinous Chrysalis patterns
spiral through the fabric, hardening it with natural resilience.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 3)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Target:</ansi>      body armor
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chrysalis setting (x1), mutation catalyst (x1),
                 binding paste (x1)

